Z||000000||stsmithgt||03-13-2001||09:33 AM||||I couldn't stand it anymore  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">.  I ordered a new throttle cable and took care of my cable woahs this last weekend.  I also couldn't find 1st gear half the time, second would want to grind a little if I had the engine revved up going into it, and reverse was a bitc---pain...I got my new throttle cable in on Thursday, adjusted my tranny linkage on Friday and installed my new cable on Saterday.  What a difference that made!! My gas peddle moves smooth and light and my tranny shifts soooo much better.  No more, "Where's that &*%$^&%#$ first gear! ZOOM! Dang gas peddle was stuck until it popped loose and went to about half throttle!!" Now I'm having fun driving again almost to the point of getting in trouble. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/centercon1.jpg"> <BR>Now where was that cable again.???? he he, what a puzzle. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||14
